+---
+webrtc-sys: patch
+libwebrtc: patch
+livekit: patch
+livekit-ffi: patch
+---
+
+Fence pre-encoded reference continuity across WebRTC encoder-queue drops.
+The pass-through encoder requests a fresh keyframe and suppresses dependent
+access units until it arrives, instead of forwarding a damaged reference chain.
+Continuity is private to each encoder and resets on encoder/source replacement.
